<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1690_6185.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig diennst zuvor,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fuersichtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eersamen</unclear> unnd weisen, be-
<lb n="3"/>sonnders liebe unnd guete <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesteren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spaet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sPerr</unclear>:
<lb n="5"/>zeit, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glaeublich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anngelanngt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bre</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genz</unclear></placeName> lermen gemacht, und darauf <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zusamen</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>lauff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mannschafft</unclear> beschehen sey:
<lb n="8"/>allß haben wir nicht sollen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnderlassen</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> unnser Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demvor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebenmaeßig</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">notwenndige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersehung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuethun</unclear>, wie auch
<lb n="11"/>zue wasser und Lannd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kundtschafften</unclear> außzue-
<lb n="12"/>sennden: umb, auf <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bessern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erkuendigung</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>nicht allain unnß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darnach</unclear> zuehallten,
<lb n="14"/>sonndern auch andere benachbarte solches zue
<lb n="15"/>avisieren, und, im fall der not, ihnen, nach
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear>, zue succurrieren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sobd</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/>Dieweil aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außgeschickhte</unclear>, bey
<lb n="18"/>nacht und nebel nichts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">annders</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wach</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/>ten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liblach</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungewiße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andraeung</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>frembden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volcks</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1690_6186.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="21"/>und doch, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aufgehendem</unclear> tag, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kraeiden</unclear>- oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">losungsschueß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> dem schloß
<lb n="23"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bregenz</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>. So <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hat</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unmbgengliche</unclear> notturfft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedunckht</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ratsbottschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">naher</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statt</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bregenz</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="26"/>abzuordnen, wie auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainschiht</unclear> naher
<lb n="27"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-105" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuessach</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueversenden</unclear>. Da sich nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beed</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seits</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befunden</unclear>, das diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lermen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> vollen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">foerster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dergestaltt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erregt</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>das durch denselben, etliche andere volle
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesellen</unclear>, die er angetroffen, zum <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abtrib</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">feinds</unclear>, so schon am <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-92" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhein</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lig</unclear>, aufgemahnt,
<lb n="33"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiber</unclear>- und gemaine
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volckh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> solchen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schreckhen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geiagt</unclear>, das
<lb n="35"/>daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschreij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuessach</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fuessach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-127" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hard</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hard</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-60" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bre</unclear>-
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genz</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ie</unclear> lenger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sterckher</unclear>, wie es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuezugehn</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pflegt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erschollen</unclear>, und doch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ann</unclear> sich selbs
<lb n="39"/>nichts gewesen, und, Gott lob, noch nichts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ist</unclear>.
<lb n="40"/>Welchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlauf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1690_6187.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="41"/>wir, guoter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundtlicher</unclear> nachbarlich
<lb n="42"/>wolmainung, bey diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zufaellig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pot</unclear>-
<lb n="43"/>schafft, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vertrewlich</unclear> berichten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, und
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erpieten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. nachbarlich
<lb n="45"/>diennsten und aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutwilligkait</unclear>, goettlich
<lb n="46"/>gnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> zumal wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befelchend</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="47"/><origDate resp="#ner">21. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Julii</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">A°</unclear> 610</origDate>.
<lb n="48"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaist</unclear> und rath
<lb n="49"/>der statt Lindaw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1690_6188.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="50"/>Den fuersichtigen, ersamen und weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">bur
<lb n="51"/>germaister unnd rath der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="52"/>unnsern besonndern lieben unnd gueten
<lb n="53"/>freunden.
<lb n="54"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">S. Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
